#: admin/views/settings.php:500
msgid "Privacy Request Retention Period (months)"
msgstr ""

#: admin/views/settings.php:502
msgid "How long completed privacy (DSAR) request records are kept before automatic deletion. They are the evidence that a data-subject request was answered, so a minimum of 12–24 months is recommended. Default is 24 months."
